  "prefLabel": "Lab 1303.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1303.01 Purpose. A licensing procedure for elevator and accessibility lift mechanics and inspectors was created by the legislature. These rules are intended to carry out the intent of RSA 157-B by establishing standards for the licensing and regulation of elevator and accessibility lift mechanics and inspectors.\n\nSource. #6368, eff 10-31-96; ss by #6845, eff 9-1-98; ss by #8706, INTERIM, eff 8-19-06, EXPIRED: 2-15-07\n\nNew. #8880, eff 4-28-07; ss by #10715, eff 11-10-14; ss by #14313, eff 7-11-25, EXPIRES: 7-11-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab1300.html"
